219" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwAvs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"legend","href":"./Template:Legend"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"#808080"},"2":{"wt":"Vacant{{efn |As a result of death, resignation, or expulsion}}"}},"i":0}}]}'><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r981673959" about="#mwt220" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Legend/styles.css"}}'/></span><div class="legend" about="#mwt219" id="mwAvw"><span class="legend-color mw-no-invert" style="background-color:#808080; color:black;-webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact;"><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span></span><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span>Vacant<sup about="#mwt221" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-5" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"group":"lower-alpha"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-5"}}'><a href="#cite_note-5" data-mw-group="lower-alpha" id="mwAv0"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAv4"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAv8">[</span>d<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAwA">]</span></span></a></sup></div></figcaption></figure>
<!--Eleanor Holmes Norton is NOT a representative and should not be counted as such. That is why the sentence is "(total retirements minus 1) representatives and one non&#x2D;voting delegate".-->
<p id="mwAwE">60 representatives and two non-voting delegates (26 Democrats and 36 Republicans) have announced their retirement, 29 of whom (9 Democrats and 20 Republicans) are retiring to run for other offices. This is the second-most retirements of representatives in a single election cycle in US history next to <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1992_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections" title="1992 United States House of Representatives elections" id="mwAwI">1992</a>, which saw 65 total retirements.<sup about="#mwt225" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-6" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-6"}}'><a href="#cite_note-6" id="mwAwM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAwQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAwU">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAwY">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

