</section><section data-mw-section-id="26" id="mwBnY" aria-labelledby="Crossover_seats"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Crossover_seats">Crossover seats</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=26" title="Edit section: Crossover seats"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwBnc">This is a list of congressional seats that voted for one party in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_United_States_presidential_election" title="2024 United States presidential election" id="mwBng">2024 presidential election</a> and another in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2024_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections" title="2024 United States House of Representatives elections" id="mwBnk">2024 House elections</a>.<sup about="#mwt707" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-96" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-96"}}'><a href="#cite_note-96" id="mwBno"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBns"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBnw">[</span>91<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBn0">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<section data-mw-section-id="27" id="mwBn4" aria-labelledby="Democratic_3"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Democratic_3">Democratic</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections&amp;action=edit&amp;section=27" title="Edit section: Democratic"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
