<th id="mwCo4"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#New_York" class="mw-selflink-fragment" id="mwCo8">New York</a></th>
<td style="background: #FFE3E3; color: black; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; " class="table-no2 skin-invert" typeof="mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt1159" id="mwCpA" data-mw='{"parts":["|",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"no2","href":"./Template:No2"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"Districts left in place"}},"i":0}}]}'>Districts left in place</td>
<td id="mwCpE">Voters in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_York's_11th_congressional_district" title="New York's 11th congressional district" id="mwCpI">NY-11</a> filed a lawsuit in October 2025, claiming the Staten Island-based district illegally dilutes the power of Black and Hispanic voters in the district.<sup about="#mwt1162" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-159" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-159"}}'><a href="#cite_note-159" id="mwCpM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCpQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCpU">[</span>148<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCpY">]</span></span></a></sup> Acting <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/New_York_Supreme_Court" title="New York Supreme Court" id="mwCpc">New York Supreme Court</a> Justice <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jeffrey_Pearlman" title="Jeffrey Pearlman" id="mwCpg">Jeffrey Pearlman</a> ordered the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Independent_redistricting_commission" title="Independent redistricting commission" class="mw-redirect" id="mwCpk">independent redistricting commission</a> to make new maps to reconfigure NY-11 by February 6, 2026.<sup about="#mwt1165" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-NYMap_160-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"NYMap"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-NYMap-160"}}'><a href="#cite_note-NYMap-160" id="mwCpo"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCps"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCpw">[</span>149<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCp0">]</span></span></a></sup> The deadline was suspended after <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nicole_Malliotakis" title="Nicole Malliotakis" id="mwCp4">Rep. Malliotakis</a>, who represents the district, appealed the ruling.<sup about="#mwt1168" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-161" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-161"}}'><a href="#cite_note-161" id="mwCp8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCqA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCqE">[</span>150<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCqI">]</span></span></a></sup> On March 2, the U.S. Supreme Court temporarily blocked Pearlman's order, allowing the state's current map to be used for the 2026 election.<sup about="#mwt1171" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-162" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-162"}}'><a href="#cite_note-162" id="mwCqM"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCqQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCqU">[</span>151<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCqY">]</span></span></a></sup></td>
<td data-sort-value="1" id="mwCqc"><span typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:File" about="#mwt1172" id="mwCqg" data-mw='{"caption":"Steady","parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Same","href":"./Template:Same"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'><span title="Steady"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Steady2.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Steady2.svg/20px-Steady2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Steady2.svg/40px-Steady2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Steady" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="drawing" height="11" width="11" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span></td>
