<tr id="mwCq0">
<th id="mwCq4"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#North_Carolina" class="mw-selflink-fragment" id="mwCq8">North Carolina</a></th>
<td data-sort-value="Yes" style="background: #DFD; color:black; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; " class="table-yes2 skin-invert" typeof="mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt1175" id="mwCrA" data-mw='{"parts":["|data-sort-value=0 ",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ya","href":"./Template:Ya"},"params":{"text":{"wt":"[[2025 North Carolina redistricting|New districts enacted]]"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2025_North_Carolina_redistricting" title="2025 North Carolina redistricting" class="mw-redirect">New districts enacted</a></td>
<td id="mwCrE">The state Senate passed the bill for a new map making the competitive 1st congressional district more Republican-leaning on October 21, 2025. The state House passed it the next day. The governor, Josh Stein, does not have the authority to veto the map.<sup about="#mwt1178" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-NCmap_120-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"NCmap"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-NCmap-120"}}'><a href="#cite_note-NCmap-120" id="mwCrI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCrM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCrQ">[</span>110<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCrU">]</span></span></a></sup> It has received pushback from the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NAACP" title="NAACP" id="mwCrY">NAACP</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_Cause" title="Common Cause" id="mwCrc">Common Cause</a>, both of which accused the new map of diluting the minority vote. A hearing was held on November 19 to consider blocking the map.<sup about="#mwt1181" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-163" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-163"}}'><a href="#cite_note-163" id="mwCrg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCrk"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCro">[</span>152<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCrs">]</span></span></a></sup></td>
<td id="mwCrw"><span typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:File" about="#mwt1182" id="mwCr0" data-mw='{"caption":"Steady","parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"steady","href":"./Template:Steady"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'><span title="Steady"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Steady2.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Steady2.svg/20px-Steady2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Steady2.svg/40px-Steady2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Steady" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="drawing" height="11" width="11" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span></td>
<td id="mwCr4"><span typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:File" about="#mwt1183" id="mwCr8" data-mw='{"caption":"Decrease","parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"decrease","href":"./Template:Decrease"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'><span title="Decrease"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Decrease2.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Decrease2.svg/20px-Decrease2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Decrease2.svg/40px-Decrease2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Decrease" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="drawing" height="11" width="11" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span> 1</td>
