<tr id="mwCsI">
<th id="mwCsM"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="#Ohio" class="mw-selflink-fragment" id="mwCsQ">Ohio</a></th>
<td data-sort-value="Yes" style="background: #DFD; color:black; vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; " class="table-yes2 skin-invert" typeof="mw:Transclusion" about="#mwt1185" id="mwCsU" data-mw='{"parts":["|data-sort-value=0 ",{"template":{"target":{"wt":"ya","href":"./Template:Ya"},"params":{"text":{"wt":"New districts enacted"}},"i":0}}]}'>New districts enacted</td>
<td id="mwCsY">Ohio voters amended the constitution in 2018, creating a process that requires both Republicans and Democrats in the state legislature to vote on the new congressional map. In the 2020 redistricting cycle, Democrats did not back a Republican proposal, necessitating a new map to be drawn in 2025. In October 2025, the Ohio Redistricting Commission passed a compromise map in a unanimous vote. The new map makes the 1st district more competitive, the 9th district lean more Republican, and the 13th district lean more Democratic.<sup about="#mwt1188" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-OHnewmap_113-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"OHnewmap"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-OHnewmap-113"}}'><a href="#cite_note-OHnewmap-113" id="mwCsc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwCsg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCsk">[</span>103<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwCso">]</span></span></a></sup></td>
<td id="mwCss"><span typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:File" about="#mwt1189" id="mwCsw" data-mw='{"caption":"Steady","parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"steady","href":"./Template:Steady"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'><span title="Steady"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Steady2.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Steady2.svg/20px-Steady2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/96/Steady2.svg/40px-Steady2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Steady" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="drawing" height="11" width="11" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span></td>
<td id="mwCs0"><span typeof="mw:Transclusion mw:File" about="#mwt1190" id="mwCs4" data-mw='{"caption":"Decrease","parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"decrease","href":"./Template:Decrease"},"params":{},"i":0}}]}'><span title="Decrease"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Decrease2.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Decrease2.svg/20px-Decrease2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Decrease2.svg/40px-Decrease2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Decrease" data-file-width="300" data-file-height="300" data-file-type="drawing" height="11" width="11" class="mw-file-element"/></span></span> 2</td>
