ata-mw-group="lower-alpha">As well as five of the six <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delegate_(United_States_Congress)" title="Delegate (United States Congress)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwLLk">non-voting delegates</a></span></li>
